            "content_html": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN URL</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/replacesClientId\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/replacesClientId</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/replacesClientId#browser_compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/replacesClientId#browser_compatibility</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">FetchEvent.replacesClientId</code> page documents a feature that was removed from all browsers more than 2 years ago.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What did you expect to see?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The page should no longer exist.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The BCD data was removed in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2527291283\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24443\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/24443/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/24443\">mdn/browser-compat-data#24443</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Reported by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/c-antin/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/c-antin\">@c-antin</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3680067537\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url